Depends: @DEPENDS@
Recommends: libvulkan1, mesa-vulkan-drivers | vulkan-icd, libegl1, libxkbcommon0, libxkbcommon-x11-0, libwayland-client0, libwayland-cursor0, libwayland-egl1, libx11-6, libx11-xcb1, libxcursor1, libxi6, libxrandr2
Section: graphics
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/xls/pandite
Description: fast offline image viewer
 Pandite is a GPU image viewer written in Rust with wgpu. It opens JPEG,
 PNG, GIF, WebP, AVIF, JPEG XL, TIFF, OpenEXR, SVG, Photoshop and camera
 RAW files. Reads and decodes run on worker threads, so a slow file never
 freezes the window. It has no account, no telemetry and no network code.
 .
 The program loads the Vulkan or EGL driver and the X11 or Wayland
 libraries at run time, so they are recommendations, not dependencies.
